# Formspree Contact Form Endpoint Configuration
# 1. Sign up for free at https://formspree.io
# 2. Create a new form (e.g. "Portfolio Contact Form")
# 3. Copy your Form ID (the alphanumeric string at the end of https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID)
# 4. Set this variable in your local .env file and in your production deployment settings (Vercel, Netlify, Render, GitHub Pages, etc.)
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=
